      "Title": "Binomial Theorem",
      "ExplanationParagraphs": [
        "Binomial theorem: (a+b)^n=Σ_(k=0)^n C(n,k)a^(n−k)b^k.",
        "Binomial coefficients form Pascal's triangle and obey C(n,k)=C(n,n−k).",
        "Terms combine powers of a and b of total degree n.",
        "Use factorial or recursion to calculate coefficients without expanding all products.",
        "Independent Cool-down: calculate a representative source-family example and check the result with the definition."
